flowchart TD
 A[Employee Research Request] --> B[Understand Goal and Scope]
 B --> C[Planner: Break into Steps]
 C --> D[Select Appropriate Tool]
 D --> E[Search Internal Documents or Web]
 E --> F[Observe and Evaluate Evidence]
 F --> G{Enough Reliable Evidence?}
 G -- No --> H[Refine Query or Retry]
 H --> D
 G -- Yes --> I[Compare and Summarize Findings]
 I --> J[Validate Sources and Gaps]
 J --> K[Generate Report with Citations]
 K --> L[Human Review and Final Output]
